  "detail_html": "<h4>功能特点</h4><ul><li>系留无人机应急通讯系统主要由系留箱、机载电源和通讯基站组成，其中系留箱集成了AC/DC转换电源、系留线缆、收放线装置、伺服电机、通信模块、散热系统以及控制管理系统等；系留箱将市电、发电机或移动电源等供电设备所提供的交流电转换为高压直流电，通过系留线缆传输至机载电源，机载电源将高压直流电转换为低压直流电为无人机以及通讯基站等任务载荷供电，以实现可达12h不间断飞行，使其能够完美的完成长时间应急通讯任务。</li><li>系留中继系统主要用于应急场景下的信号中转，系统已与各大通讯运营商建立了深度合作关系，可灵活搭载Tel设备、短波通信设备，以满足多样化通信需求。其典型应用场景包括：在灾难现场快速搭建中继信号传输链路，保障救援指挥与信息传递的畅通；在戈壁滩、矿山等无信号覆盖区域快速搭建中继信号网络，填补通信空白；以及在山区等复杂地形环境中快速构建局域通信网络，实现360°全方位无线监控，确保关键信息的实时传输与共享。</li><li>图1 FC-YJTX-01无人机</li><li>技术指标</li><li>应用场景</li><li>震后应急通讯搭建</li><li>水灾应急通讯搭建</li><li>强台风后应急通讯搭建</li></ul><div class=\"product-images\"><img src=\"/products/uav-systems/FC-YJTX-01-Emergency-Communication-Drone.png\" alt=\"应急通讯无人机\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" /><img src=\"/products/media/v3_01应急通讯无人机_2.png\" alt=\"应急通讯无人机\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" /><img src=\"/products/media/v3_01应急通讯无人机_3.png\" alt=\"应急通讯无人机\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" /><img src=\"/products/media/v3_01应急通讯无人机_4.png\" alt=\"应急通讯无人机\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" /><img src=\"/products/media/v3_01应急通讯无人机_5.png\" alt=\"应急通讯无人机\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" /><img src=\"/products/media/v3_01应急通讯无人机_6.png\" alt=\"应急通讯无人机\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" /></div>",
  "detail_html_en": "<h4>Features</h4><ul><li>The tethered drone emergency communication system mainly consists of a tethered box, onboard power supply, and communication base station. The tethered box integrates AC/DC conversion power, tethered cables, winding device, servo motors, communication modules, cooling systems, and control management systems. The tethered box converts AC power from the grid, generators, or mobile power sources into high-voltage DC power, transmitted through the tethered cable to the onboard power supply. The onboard power supply then converts high-voltage DC into low-voltage DC to power the drone and mission payloads such as base stations, enabling up to 12 hours of flight for long-duration emergency communication tasks.</li><li>The tethered relay system is mainly used for signal relay in emergency scenarios. The system has established deep partnerships with major telecommunication operators and can flexibly carry Tel equipment and shortwave communication devices to meet diverse communication needs. Typical application scenarios include: Rapidly building relay signal transmission links at disaster sites to ensure smooth rescue command and information transmission; building relay signal networks in areas with no signal coverage such as Gobi deserts and mines; and rapidly building local communication networks in complex mountainous environments to achieve 360° all-round wireless monitoring and ensuring real-time transmission and sharing of critical information.</li><li>Figure 1 FC-YJTX-01 Drone</li><li>Technical Specifications</li><li>Application Scenarios</li><li>Post-earthquake emergency communication setup</li><li>Flood emergency communication setup</li><li>Emergency communication setup after strong typhoon</li></ul><div class=\"product-images\"><img src=\"/products/uav-systems/FC-YJTX-01-Emergency-Communication-Drone.png\" alt=\"Emergency Communication Drone\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" /><img src=\"/products/media/v3_01应急通讯无人机_2.png\" a